NOTE ON SCOPE
This license covers the original MochiNet files in this repository. It does
NOT cover third-party components, which keep their own licenses:
  • NimBLE-Arduino, Adafruit libraries, SmartRC-CC1101-Driver-Lib — as
    distributed by their authors.
  • The JCMK ESP-NOW protocol is reimplemented here, not copied; the Piglet
    node firmware (hamspiced, CC BY-NC 4.0) is NOT included in this repo.
See CREDITS.md for details.

NOTE ON USE
MochiNet includes WiFi/RF tools capable of disrupting networks. It is provided
for authorized security testing and education only. The author is not liable
for misuse. Using these tools against networks or devices you do not own or
have permission to test is illegal in most jurisdictions.
